        "correct": false,
        "why": "It hands req.url over untouched."
      },
      {
        "text": "Lesson 5's router was case-sensitive",
        "correct": false,
        "why": "That is true and unrelated to the slash."
      },
      {
        "text": "A trailing slash is ignored",
